MODIFICATIONS BY Keep LTS (unofficial security-maintenance fork)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This distribution is a fork of `xlsx` (SheetJS Community Edition) version 0.18.5
— the last version published to the npm registry. It applies two security fixes
that SheetJS shipped only in later, CDN-only releases, back-ported to the 0.18.5
baseline so that npm consumers have a remediated drop-in:

  * CVE-2023-30533 (prototype pollution on file read)
      ported from the SheetJS 0.19.3 fix to `sheet_insert_comments`.
  * CVE-2024-22363 (ReDoS in core-property parsing)
      ported from the SheetJS 0.20.2 fix (indexOf-based `str_match_xml`).

The changed regions in xlsx.js are marked with `CVE-...` comments. No other
functional changes have been made; legitimate parsing is byte-for-byte equivalent
to upstream 0.18.5 (verified by a cross-version equivalence test).

